# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository tracks CODE ONLY. Everything below is produced by that code,
# or is narrative about it, and lives locally instead. Nothing here is deleted
# from working trees; it is simply not versioned.
#
# The manuscript lives locally and on Overleaf, with submission bundles built
# by paper/make_overleaf_bundle.py, paper/make_workshop_bundle.py and
# paper/make_supplementary.ps1. The supplementary assembler reads docs/ and the
# code tree directly, so it keeps working from a clean checkout plus local runs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
paper/
writeup/

# experiment outputs: logs, per-run JSON, mined CSVs, calibration dumps.
# Regenerated by the batch/ job scripts; ~180MB and not source.
Results/

# poster filmstrips (rendered rollouts), ~17MB of npz
strips/

